{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26686","headline":"寄周十七起居 · 姚合","name":"寄周十七起居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"冬冬九陌鼓声齐，百辟朝天马乱嘶。\n月照浓霜寒更远，风吹红烛举还低。\n官清立在金鑪北，仗下归眠玉殿西。\n莫笑老人多独出，晴山荒景觅诗题。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚合","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26686.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26686","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}